        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. An employee may work those scheduled hours which may exceed the combined eight (8) per day or forty (40) per week situation if mutually agreed upon by the Company and the Employee. In no event shall such hours be considered overtime pursuant to Section 9 (A) of this Agreement, unless and until the employee's work for the Employer exceeds eight (8) hours per day or forty (40) hours per payroll week.",
            "block_bbox": [
